                "text": "The Cuban regime\u2019s so-called \u201cmedical missions\u201d are nothing but modern-day slavery. Doctors are trafficked abroad, stripped of their rights, and forced to work while the regime pockets their pay.\nCountries that participate in this scheme aren\u2019t helping, they\u2019re funding repression.\n\nI support @SecRubio\u2019s visa bans on officials who profit from this abuse. No nation should enrich a dictatorship by exploiting its own people.\n\nIt\u2019s time to end these slave missions and stand with the Cuban people.\n\nhttps://t.co/doSf6J9xnY",
